      "q": "1. Line-of-business selection:\nThe nature and sort of business to be undertaken are the first decisions that an entrepreneur must make. He or she will undoubtedly want to pursue that field of industry and commerce that offers the greatest potential for profit. The decision will be impacted by market customer requirements as well as the entrepreneur's technical competence and enthusiasm in developing a specific product.",
